  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Scrub a transformer's hidden-state trajectories layer by layer over a 3-D density terrain of 2-D-projected states, compare prompts or models on one shared terrain, and check projection fidelity and density uncertainty before trusting any basin. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
